Hint:\(a=\frac{dv}{dt} \)

Step 1:Find the restoring force.
The equation of position of SHO is given by;
\(x=A\sin(\omega t)\)
Now, find the equation of velocity of SHO;
\(v=\frac{dx}{dt}=A\omega\cos(\omega t)\)
Now, find the equation of acceleration of SHO;
\(a=\frac{dv}{dt}=-A\omega^2\sin(\omega t)~~~...(1)\)
Now, apply Newton's 2nd equation of motion;
\(F_{res}=ma=-mA\omega^2\sin{\omega t}\)
By using equation (1) we get the restoring force as;
\(F_{res}=-mA\omega^2\sin{\omega t}\)
Step 2:Find the net force acting on SHO.
\(F_{net}=F_{res}+F_{ext}\)
Therefore;
\(F_{net}=-mA\omega^2\sin{\omega t}+\sin(t)~~~...(2)\)
Step 3:Find the net acceleration of SHO.
Again apply Newton's 2nd law of motion;
\(a_{net}=\frac{F_{net}}{m}\)
Now, by using equation (2);
\(a_{net}=\frac{-mA\omega^2\sin{\omega t}+\sin(t)}{m}\)
Simplify.
\(a_{net}=-A\omega^2\sin(\omega t)+\frac{1}{m}\sin(t)~~~...(3)\)
Step 4:Find the position function at any time\(t.\)
Integrate equation (3) with respect to time;
\(v'=\int adt=A\omega\cos(\omega t)-\frac{1}{m}\cos(t)+C_1~~~...(3)\)
By using given initial condition, at\(t=0;\Rightarrow v=0\). Hence;
\(0=A\omega-\frac{1}{m}+C_1\Rightarrow C_1=A\omega-\frac{1}{m}\)
Therefore, equation (3) becomes;
\(v'=A\omega\cos(\omega t)-\frac{1}{m}\cos(t)+A\omega-\frac{1}{m}\)
Now, find the position function using above equation;
\(x'=\int vdt=A\sin(\omega t)-\frac{1}{m}\sin(t)+A\omega
t-\frac{t}{m}+C_2~~~...(4)\)
By using given initial condition, at\(t=0;\Rightarrow x=0\). Hence;
\(0=0-0+0-0+C_2\Rightarrow C_2=0\)
Therefore, equation (3) becomes;
\(x'=A\sin(\omega t)-\frac{1}{m}\sin(t)+A\omega t-\frac{t}{m}\)
Now, substitute the known values;
\(x'=A\sin(2t)-\frac{1}{m}\sin(t)+2At-\frac{t}{m}\)
By taking the negative sign common;
\(x'=- \left ( \frac{1}{m}\sin(t)-A\sin(2t) \right ) +2At-\frac{t}{m}\)
Therefore;
\(x'\propto\left\{\sin(t)-\frac{1}{2}\sin(2t) \right\}\)
Hence, option(4)is the correct answer.<div style="margin-top:1.25rem; padding:0.85rem 1rem; background:var(--bg-secondary); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;"><div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.6rem; font-weight:600; font-size:0.88rem;"><span>📊 Student Attempt Analytics</span><span style="padding:2px 8px; border-radius:12px; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; background:rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color:#dc2626;">🔴 Hard · 35% Got This Correct</span></div><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0.5rem; text-align:center; font-size:0.82rem;"><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(1)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">14%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(2)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">31%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(3)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">21%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.12); border:1.5px solid #22c55e;"><div style="color:#16a34a; font-weight:700;">(4) ✓</div><div style="font-weight:800; color:#16a34a; margin-top:2px;">36%</div></div></div></div>

